
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Project One — Huon Portfolio</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f6f5f1;
      --text: #191919;
      --muted: #737373;
      --accent: #c8f169;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 24px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #deddd7;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .back {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .intro {
      padding: 65px 0 35px;
    }

    .tag {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 680px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .details {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 35px 0;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #deddd7;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #deddd7;
    }

    .details strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .details span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
      padding-bottom: 65px;
    }

    .gallery img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #e7e5de;
    }

    .caption {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: -10px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .end {
      padding: 30px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #deddd7;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      h1 { letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

    <header>
      <a class="back" href="index.html">← Back to portfolio</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="intro">
        <div class="tag">Graphic Design · 2026</div>

        <h1>Project One</h1>

        <p class="description">
          Write your project description here. Explain your concept,
          inspiration, design decisions, and the message you wanted
          to communicate through your work.
        </p>

        <div class="details">
          <div>
            <strong>Category</strong>
            <span>Graphic Design</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Tools</strong>
            <span>Photoshop, Illustrator</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Year</strong>
            <span>2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="gallery">
        <img src="images/project-one/main.jpg"
             alt="Main project artwork">

        <p class="caption">
          Figure 01 — Main artwork
        </p>

        <h2>Concept and inspiration</h2>

        <p class="description">
          Describe the ideas behind this project, your visual research,
          references, and the reasons for choosing this direction.
        </p>

        <img src="images/project-one/process.jpg"
             alt="Project design process">

        <p class="caption">
          Figure 02 — Design process
        </p>

        <img src="images/project-one/detail.jpg"
             alt="Close-up of the project">

        <p class="caption">
          Figure 03 — Artwork details
        </p>

        <img src="images/project-one/final.jpg"
             alt="Final project presentation">

        <p class="caption">
          Figure 04 — Final presentation
        </p>

        <h2>Final outcome</h2>

        <p class="description">
          Explain the final result, what you learned, and how the
          finished work meets the original project goals.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="end">
      <a href="index.html">← Back to all projects</a>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>

